WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.034 --> 00:00:02.362
Badger stopped.

2
00:00:02.363 --> 00:00:05.582
The others stopped behind him.

3
00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:09.973
"We're under the closet floor," said Badger.

4
00:00:09.974 --> 00:00:14.402
They listened to the noise above.

5
00:00:14.403 --> 00:00:18.098
The cheering sounded like thunder.

6
00:00:18.099 --> 00:00:21.673
All the Wild-Wooders were shouting.

7
00:00:21.674 --> 00:00:26.007
"A lot of weasels are up there," said Mole.

8
00:00:26.008 --> 00:00:29.401
"Ferrets too," said Rat.

9
00:00:29.402 --> 00:00:33.671
Above their heads was a square door.

10
00:00:33.672 --> 00:00:37.685
"Now—all together!" said Badger.

11
00:00:37.686 --> 00:00:42.029
They pushed on the door, and it flew open.

12
00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:46.673
One by one, the friends climbed up.

13
00:00:46.674 --> 00:00:49.740
"Well, we made it," said Rat.

14
00:00:49.741 --> 00:00:53.292
"We're inside my closet," said Toad.

15
00:00:53.293 --> 00:00:59.327
The enemy was on the other side of the door.

16
00:00:59.328 --> 00:01:04.226
Suddenly the Wild-Wooders were quiet.

17
00:01:04.227 --> 00:01:11.031
"I would like to praise good old Toad!" said a voice.

18
00:01:11.032 --> 00:01:14.382
All the weasels laughed.

19
00:01:14.383 --> 00:01:18.657
"His beds are very warm!" said the voice.

20
00:01:18.658 --> 00:01:22.143
The ferrets yelled happily.

21
00:01:22.144 --> 00:01:26.902
"His food tastes very good!" said a voice.

22
00:01:26.903 --> 00:01:30.908
The Wild-Wooders stamped their feet.

23
00:01:30.909 --> 00:01:36.227
"Let's go in there!" said Toad angrily.

24
00:01:36.228 --> 00:01:41.587
"Shhh!" said Badger, holding Toad.

25
00:01:41.588 --> 00:01:46.997
"Now let's sing a song for Toad!" said a voice.

26
00:01:46.998 --> 00:01:49.236
[i@He drove too fast,@i]

27
00:01:49.237 --> 00:01:51.748
[i@His fun didn't last.@i]

28
00:01:51.749 --> 00:01:55.740
[i@Now Toady sits in jail!@i]

29
00:01:55.741 --> 00:01:59.102
Everyone clapped and sang.

30
00:01:59.103 --> 00:02:02.863
Badger gripped his club hard.

31
00:02:02.864 --> 00:02:06.998
"Get ready!" he said.

32
00:02:06.999 --> 00:02:14.637
The friends burst through the door.

